{"id":"8f32f747a261016d","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-theory-hierarchy-strict.md","title":"保守等价类之后的严格算术强度链","display":"prop-theory-hierarchy-strict — 保守等价类之后的严格算术强度链","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-theory-hierarchy-strict","aliases":["91-prop-theory-hierarchy-strict"],"display":"prop-theory-hierarchy-strict — 保守等价类之后的严格算术强度链","depends_on":["[[91-df-TB]]","[[91-df-UTB]]","[[91-df-FS]]","[[91-df-KF]]","[[91-df-VF]]","[[91-df-truth-strength]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-theory-hierarchy-strict"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-theory-hierarchy-strict</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-theory-hierarchy-strict — 保守等价类之后的严格算术强度链"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6018cc1b13710826\" href=\"?note=6018cc1b13710826\" title=\"91-df-TB\">91-df-TB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2f215d3f10d33ae6\" href=\"?note=2f215d3f10d33ae6\" title=\"91-df-UTB\">91-df-UTB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"25c37fe51095276d\" href=\"?note=25c37fe51095276d\" title=\"91-df-FS\">91-df-FS</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"669ee474b9646a38\" href=\"?note=669ee474b9646a38\" title=\"91-df-VF\">91-df-VF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c87db4d1858a0009\" href=\"?note=c87db4d1858a0009\" title=\"91-df-truth-strength\">91-df-truth-strength</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA},\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{VF}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA},\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{VF}\\)</span> (标准理论版本)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathcal A\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (共同的算术后果类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\equiv_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\equiv_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\prec_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\prec_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span>\n(算术后果等强与严格包含)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}theory\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}strict}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TB}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{UTB}\n\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{PA}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{FS}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{KF}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{VF}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}theory\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}strict}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TB}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{UTB}\n\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{PA}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{FS}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{KF}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{VF}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>TB 与 UTB 都对 PA 的算术语言保守，所以不存在 UTB 可证而 TB 不可证的\n算术分离句。它们在含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的语言中表达方式不同，但这不是算术强度的\n严格性。</p>\n<p>后半链来自标准证明论对应：\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>、\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\\)</span>、\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span>。因此原来把 FS 放在\nKF 之上的排序方向相反。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-TB","status":"resolved","id":"6018cc1b13710826","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-TB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-UTB","status":"resolved","id":"2f215d3f10d33ae6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-UTB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-FS","status":"resolved","id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-FS]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-VF","status":"resolved","id":"669ee474b9646a38","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-VF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-strength","status":"resolved","id":"c87db4d1858a0009","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-strength]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA},\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{VF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\equiv_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"<_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\prec_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}theory\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}strict}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TB}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{UTB}\n\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{PA}\n<_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{FS}\n<_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{KF}\n<_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{VF}.","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\varepsilon_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{ID}_1","display":false}],"bytes":1566,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["6018cc1b13710826","2f215d3f10d33ae6","25c37fe51095276d","a0a2284f96eaea1d","669ee474b9646a38","c87db4d1858a0009"]}